OK, I thought it would be cute to have a "Beachbum" character go out
with an item "bottle of suntan lotion", so, one of my first actions
was to change my fruit name to "bottle of suntan lotion". When I picked
up my second one, I expected to see "2 bottle of suntan lotion". I
boggled a bit and had to double-check when I saw "2 bottles of suntan
lotion". Sure enough, bottle, box, and bunch all create proper plurals
when used in the name of the fruit. I haven't looked at the source to
see just how many of these special cases are checked for, but, it is
true TDTTO(N)E (The Development Team Thought Of Nearly Everything).

