BeachBum notes

I didn't record notes from the start, but I know that I successfully
ran the protection racket, getting down to 1 AC via the Minetown
priest. After that, I ran up a bunch of experience levels quickly,
explored the dungeons, Sokoban, the rest of the Mines, the Quest,
and the Fort. The gold from the Fort allowed me to donate to the
priest at my main base in a co-aligned temple on Dlvl 14 and get to
-2 AC. (With only a shirt for the ascension, I want to pile on all
the divine protection I can easily get.)

T49455 I get the Castle Wand. I did the Quest first and so have the
PYEC.
T49457 First Castle Wand wish: Eyes of the Overworld
T49459 Second Castle Wand wish: Blessed, Fixed, +3 Staff of
Aesculapius (if you are not holding to "wish for no artifacts"
conduct, lets go all the way.

T50544 Consolidation and preparation at my main stash at a co-aligned
temple on Dlvl 14 uses up my scrolls of Enchant Weapon and Enchant
Armor, but does leave me with a +5 Hawiian Shirt and the +7 Staff.
With my -2 naked AC I am at -7 AC total. Plus, I have all the normal
resistances, reflection, two sources of magic resistance and hungerless
regeneration. Is this enough to tackle the rest of the game? I would
like some additional safety for my ascension attempt, so I am going to
do some more preparation...

T51103 While sacrificing to maximize luck I get Magicbane as a gift.
OK, it's a nice artifact to have.
T51361 The Castle wand was empty, so I charged it with the PYEC.
T51362 Third Castle Wand wish: uncursed magic marker
T51363 Fourth Castle Wand wish: uncursed magic marker
T51367 Some polypiling turned up a scroll of genocide. I blessed it
and eliminated L's.
T54214 I toured the dungeon back to Minetown to pick up candles and
all the elven armor I could find. I also played with poly traps in
the Big room and got a pet Minotaur and Marilith. We'll see if they
last.
T54275 I used magic markers to make enchant armor scrolls and generated

a +7 and +6 elven helms and a +6 elven shield, lets see if I can get
one of them to poly into a Hawaiian shirt...
T55343 Well, no. I also created a +7 elven mithiril and zapped it and
the others through a number of different types of armor, but no shirts.

I guess I'll try exploring down as I am.
T55462 I do some alchemy to make 15 blessed potions of full healing
and run my HP from 147 to 267.
T57050 I invade the Valley with my Marilith, Ice Troll and Minotaur.
T79800 Well, I explored down to the vibrating square, then back all
the way to the top (I was incautious and lost some memory to a Mind
Flayer). I stayed at my stash for a while getting organized for the
ascension run.
Now, I feel that I am ready to start.



